        "contenuto_esteso": "Sen. Mark Warner (D-Va.) on Sunday criticized his party for being \"way too bureaucratic\" as the party battles consistent unpopularity in the polls. “I think the Democrats have not — you know, need to articulate a fuller strategy, not just against [President] Trump. I want the Democratic Party to be pro-growth, pro-innovation, and actually about..."
